        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ab322b28-a62f-5ab6-b2c8-a02e3100568b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Brolin, Nathan Summers, Spike Lee, Mark Protosevich, Elizabeth Olsen, Sharlto Copley\n- Characters: Cable\n- Organizations: Marvel Comics, X-Force, X-Men\n- Films: Deadpool 2, Oldboy\n- Events: X-Cutioner's Song\n\nFacts:\n- Cable, whose full name is Nathan Summers, is a fictional character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\n- Cable is commonly associated with X-Force and the X-Men.\n- X-Cutioner's Song was heavily promoted as revealing the origin of Cable, but Cable's origin was ultimately not covered in any installment.\n- Oldboy is a 2013 film directed by Spike Lee and written by Mark Protosevich.\n- Oldboy stars Josh Brolin, Elizabeth Olsen, and Sharlto Copley.\n- In April 2017, Josh Brolin was cast as Nathan Summers / Cable in the X-Men film series under a four-film contract.\n- Josh Brolin's first intended appearance as Cable in the X-Men film series was in Deadpool 2.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "e0f544bb-a33e-5c54-8918-91061d920a9a",
        "text": "Page: Josh Brolin. Sentence: In April 2017, Brolin was cast as Nathan Summers / Cable as a part of a four-film contract in the \"X-Men\" film series, with his first appearance intended to be in \"Deadpool 2\".\nPage: Cable (comics). Sentence: Cable (Nathan Summers) is a fictional character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics, commonly in association with X-Force and the X-Men.\nPage: Oldboy (2013 film). Sentence: It was directed by Spike Lee and written by Mark Protosevich, the film stars Josh Brolin, Elizabeth Olsen and Sharlto Copley.\nPage: X-Cutioner's Song. Sentence: The story was heavily hyped as revealing the origin of popular X-Force star Cable, but ultimately Cable's origin was not covered in any of the installments.",
